### Test Zelig's predictions for neg binomial and Poisson
### mean of ev seems to consistently OVERESTIMATE exp(XB)

library(foreign)
library(MASS)
library(Zelig)

## note: dataset is http://www.kenbenoit.net/courses/quant2/weede.dta
